H3Remover provides a modified LoRA adapter and an inference pipeline for mask-guided video object removal. Generated example outputs are AI-generated.

The optional automatic-mask integration calls Pi4 (https://github.com/yyfz/Pi4) and SAM 3.1 (https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam3). Their code and weights are obtained separately and retain their upstream licenses. Pi4 code and weights are licensed under CC BY-NC 4.0.
